### Problem

Using pyrefly LSP, with vim.lsp.foldexpr(), folding ranges do not work. 

Looking at pyrefly source code, they use [non-stanard kinds, perhaps.](https://github.com/facebook/pyrefly/blob/048f16031dffdc761a16fc9ca6116d3243309000/crates/pyrefly_python/src/folding.rs#L22)

Here is is some extra info:

```lua
local clientnr = 4 ---pyrefly
local bufnr = 2 ---python buf
local client = vim.lsp.get_client_by_id(clientnr) 

local resp = vim.lsp.buf_request_sync(bufnr, "textDocument/foldingRange", { textDocument = { uri = vim.uri_from_bufnr(bufnr) } })
print(resp[clientnr].result)
```
